sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FE as Browser
    participant API as /api/upload(s)
    participant Multer
    participant Conflict
    participant Meta as FileMetadata
    participant FS as Uploads

    User->>FE: Select files + options
    FE->>API: POST /api/upload with JWT
    API->>Multer: Store temp file /uploads/<user>
    Multer-->>API: File info (name,size,type)
    API->>Conflict: checkFileConflict(userId,name,size,type)
    alt Conflict & no action
        API->>FS: Delete temp file
        API-->>FE: Return conflict + suggestions
    else Conflict resolved/auto-rename/replace
        Conflict-->>API: Unique name or replace directive
        API->>FS: Move/rename file
        API->>Meta: addFile(...)
        API-->>FE: Success summary
    end
